## 🗺️ Phase-by-Phase Completion Roadmap

---

## ✅ PHASE 0 — Already Completed (Reference)

These are done and working. No action needed unless bugs surface.

- **Auth Service:** JWT registration/login, protected routes, token validation middleware in `shared/`
- **Face Verification:** MTCNN + FaceNet embedding pipeline, live camera registration & recognition endpoints
- **Tracking & Geofencing:** YOLOv8 person tracking, zone polygon definitions, alert API, RTSP support
- **Schedule Monitoring:** Activity scheduling CRUD, ML adaptive thresholds (grace period learning via NumPy), frontend with real-time detector
- **Skeleton Identification:** MediaPipe pose landmarker, SVM+LSTM ensemble, gait analysis, full React dashboard

---

## 🔴 PHASE 1 — Anomaly Detection Frontend Polish

**Effort:** ~2–3 days | **Priority:** HIGH

### What Exists
- Backend: Full inference pipeline ([ae_weights.pt](file:///c:/Secure-Eldercare-Project/anomaly-detection/backend/app/ml_services/trained_models/ae_weights.pt) + [lstm_weights.pt](file:///c:/Secure-Eldercare-Project/anomaly-detection/backend/app/ml_services/trained_models/lstm_weights.pt)), controllers, services, ML services directory with `inference/` and `scripts/`
- Frontend: Only 13 files — very minimal UI

### What Needs To Be Done

#### `anomaly-detection/frontend/src/`
| Task | File to Create/Edit | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Real-time alert dashboard | `pages/AlertDashboard.jsx` | WebSocket or polling feed of anomaly events |
| Video feed + overlay | `pages/LiveFeed.jsx` | Show RTSP feed with bounding boxes and pose skeleton |
| Alert history table | `pages/AlertHistory.jsx` | Paginated logs from `/api/anomaly/alerts` |
| Severity indicators | `components/SeverityBadge.jsx` | Color-coded: Fall / Aggression / Inactivity |
| Notification bell | `components/NotificationBell.jsx` | Real-time unread count |
| Model status widget | `components/ModelStatus.jsx` | Shows inference FPS, model loaded state |

#### Backend (Minor Gaps)
- Ensure `/api/anomaly/stream` WebSocket endpoint is wired and tested
- Add `/api/anomaly/alerts?limit=&skip=` pagination endpoint if missing
- Confirm trained model auto-loads on startup (check `ml_services/inference/` loader)

### Verification
```bash
cd anomaly-detection/backend && python run.py
cd anomaly-detection/frontend && npm run dev
# Open http://localhost:5176 → check live feed, alert table loads
```

