## 🟡 PHASE 3 — Gateway Dashboard Integration

**Effort:** ~3–4 days | **Priority:** HIGH

### What Exists
- Backend: `gateway/` directory, `services/` with 21 files (aggregates from other services via `httpx`)
- Frontend: 11 pages in `src/pages/`, routes and layouts present

### What Needs To Be Done

This is the **central hub** — it pulls data from all services. The main work is **wiring the aggregator correctly** and making the frontend fully reactive.

#### Backend Wiring (`gateway-dashboard/backend/`)
| Task | Location | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Proxy health checks for all services | `services/health_service.py` | Ping ports 8000–8005, return status |
| Aggregate active alerts | `services/alert_aggregator.py` | Combine anomaly + geofence + schedule alerts |
| Elder summary endpoint | `services/elder_summary.py` | Latest face, location, activity, anomaly per elder |
| Live metrics endpoint | `services/metrics_service.py` | Falls/day, medication compliance %, active elders |
| Notification fan-out | `services/notification.py` | Push aggregated critical alerts to caregiver app |

#### Frontend Pages (`gateway-dashboard/frontend/src/pages/`)
| Page | What to Build |
|---|---|
| `Overview.jsx` | Cards: total elders, active alerts, compliance rate, online services |
| `ElderDetails.jsx` | Single elder: face photo, current location, last activity, anomaly feed |
| `AlertCenter.jsx` | Merged alert stream from all services, acknowledge/dismiss |
| `Analytics.jsx` | Charts: falls per week, medication adherence, schedule compliance (use Chart.js or Recharts) |
| `SystemHealth.jsx` | Service status grid, uptime, error rate per microservice |
| `ElderList.jsx` | All registered elders, search, filter by risk level |

#### Integration Pattern
```
Gateway → httpx → Service APIs (8000–8005)
Gateway → Frontend via REST (polling every 5s) or WebSocket
```

### Verification
```bash
# Start all backends first
cd gateway-dashboard/backend && python run.py
cd gateway-dashboard/frontend && npm run dev
# http://localhost:5179 → verify overview shows live data from other services
```

---

## 🔵 PHASE 4 — Cross-Service Integration & Authentication Guard

**Effort:** ~2–3 days | **Priority:** MEDIUM

### What Needs To Be Done

This phase locks everything together with proper auth and ensures frontends talk to correct backends.

#### Shared Auth Guard
- Verify all 7 frontend apps check `localStorage.access_token` on load via `shared/frontend/components/ProtectedRoute.jsx`
- Confirm all non-auth frontends redirect to Auth Service (port 5173) when token is missing/expired
- Update Gateway's `AuthRedirect` to use Cloudflare tunnel URLs (not hardcoded localhost) — partially done per past conversation

#### Inter-Service Communication
- Ensure Gateway's `httpx` clients pass `Authorization: Bearer <token>` when calling other services
- Verify CORS settings in each backend allow Gateway origin
- Test token expiry: on 401 from any service, Gateway should return 401 to frontend → trigger re-login

#### Environment Configuration
```
.env (root) must define:
JWT_SECRET_KEY=
MONGO_URI=
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_URL=   ← for production routing
AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
FACE_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8001
TRACKING_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8002
ANOMALY_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8003
SCHEDULE_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8004
GATEWAY_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8005
CAREGIVER_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8006
```

#### Docker Compose Finalization
- Verify `docker-compose.yml` has all 7 services with correct port mappings
- Add health checks and `depends_on` between services
- Ensure volume mounts for ML model files (`.pt`, `.task`) in containers

### Verification
```bash
docker-compose up --build
# All services green → open each frontend, confirm protected route redirects work
```

---

## 🟣 PHASE 5 — Final Polish, Testing & Production Readiness

**Effort:** ~3–4 days | **Priority:** MEDIUM

### UI/UX Polish (All Frontends)
- Ensure Tailwind CSS classes are consistent across all 7 frontends
- Add loading skeletons for API calls
- Add error boundary components (`<ErrorBoundary>`) in each App.jsx
- Mobile-responsive layouts (critical for caregiver app used on phones)
- Unified color palette and font (currently each service may differ)

### API Testing
- Add Pytest test files to each service's `backend/` directory
- Test: auth token generation, protected route rejection, face enrollment + recognition, zone alert trigger
```bash
# Per service:
cd <service>/backend
pytest tests/ -v
```

### ML Model Validation
- Run inference benchmark on anomaly detection LSTM model:
```bash
cd anomaly-detection/backend
python app/ml_services/scripts/evaluate_model.py
```
- Run skeleton-identification pose landmarker accuracy test on sample video
- Document F1 scores in `ML_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md` (already exists, update it)

### Deployment Checklist
- Complete all items in `DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md` (already exists in root)
- Set `NODE_ENV=production` for all Vite builds
- Configure Cloudflare tunnel to route all service subdomains
- Enable MongoDB Atlas IP allowlist for production IPs

