## 🚀 Recommended Execution Order

```mermaid
graph LR
    P0[✅ Phase 0\nCore Services Done] --> P1[Phase 1\nAnomaly Frontend]
    P0 --> P2[Phase 2\nCaregiver Frontend]
    P1 --> P3[Phase 3\nGateway Integration]
    P2 --> P3
    P3 --> P4[Phase 4\nAuth + Docker]
    P4 --> P5[Phase 5\nPolish + Deploy]
```

> **Start Phase 1 and Phase 2 in parallel** — they are independent. Then Phase 3 pulls them together via the Gateway.
